      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "1. Turn on your webcam and start the game.\r\n(Keyboard support included)\r\n\r\n2.
    \"Rock\" is classified as the green trash bin, \r\nand \"Paper\" as the blue
    trash bin.\r\n\r\n3. +10 points for a correct answer\r\n-5 points for an incorrect
    answer\n\r\n4. Recognition accuracy improves if you strike a pose outside the
    frame first and then step into it.\LAlso, It is detected better when using your
    left hand."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2ab05b2b86ae4eb4c8c893c73e9198e6, type: 2}
